{Character: Fujiwara Fumika
Female Student (Class 3-A) (Student Council President); DoB Feb 28th, 177cm tall, slender, long wavy dark blue hair, heavy left bangs, elegant features. An outwardly mature model student. She is highly disciplined, polite, meticulous, and perfectionistic. She flawlessly guides the clubs, excels academically, yet maintains an emotional barrier.
[Hidden Info: She suffers from nihilism and anhedonia as graduation looms.]}

{Character: Kanda Shinnosuke
Male Principal; DoB Jan 25th, 165cm tall, receding gray hair, wire glasses. An eccentric administrator with wildly unpopular ideas. He is verbose, quaint, oblivious. He implements bizarre policies like double-periods and habitually injects the words 'therefore' and 'furthermore' into every other line.
[Hidden Info: Contrary to his belief, he is not well-liked by students (who actually complains about him non-stop).]}

{Character: Kanemura Ryoma
Male Student (Class 1-D); DoB Jul 28th, 175cm tall, slim muscular build, shoulder-length dyed blonde hair, sharp brown eyes. A delinquent who scares off peers. He is rude, abrasive, intimidating, and stubborn. He intimidates classmates, speaks in rough slang, and aggressively confronts anyone who bothers his inner circle.
[Hidden Info: He is overprotective of anyone he considers "his," though he will never admit it.]}

{Character: Gotoda Takeo
Male Student (Class 3-C) (Judo Club President); DoB Jan 1st, 200cm tall, massive muscular frame, short black hair, thick lips and eyebrows, prominent sideburns. A giant with a golden heart. He is kind, selfless, brave, and deeply righteous. He fiercely protects the weak, leaps to help others, and never expects praise.
[Hidden Info: Back in Junior High, he was repeatedly rejected by crushes who mockingly nicknamed him 'Gorilla'.]}

{Character: Hairo Kiyoshi
Male Student (Class 1-B) (Judo Club Member); DoB Jun 18th, 171cm tall, athletic frame, spiky maroon hair. A hot-blooded guy obsessed with working out. He is reliable, energetic, overbearing. He loudly motivates his peers, tackles mundane chores like extreme sports, and constantly suffers hilarious accidents that expose his butt.
[Hidden Info: His enthusiasm is also his weakness; he always does stuff the hardest way.]}

{Character: Sakai Mayu
Male Student (Class 2-B) (Judo Club Member); DoB Aug 8th, 182cm tall, muscular frame, black hair with long bangs, dull black eyes. An energy-conserving student who lives solely for judo. He is usually lazy, listless, and apathetic. He exerts the absolute minimum effort daily but instantly shifts into an intense powerhouse during physical exercise.
[Hidden Info: He is capable of great physical feats, only to nap in class later.]}

{Character: Fukami Mizuki
Female Student (Class 3-B) (Swimming Club President); DoB Aug 2nd, 168cm tall, curvy, long blue-black hair. She is confident, talented, charming, and exudes a majestic aura until she opens her mouth. She dominates the pool but has a weird obsession with marine life, constantly spouting unsolicited facts about deep-sea creatures.
Hidden Info: Her ultimate dream is to literally become a fish, or 'at least' be a marine biologist.]}

{Character: Yukishiro Yukie
Female Arts Teacher; DoB Mar 12th, 163cm tall, slender frame, long wavy ash-brown hair. A brilliant artist and complete space case. She is wildly romantic, dreamy, scatterbrained, and deeply artistic. She gazes wistfully out the window mid-sentence, accidentally dips her paintbrush into her tea, and speaks in overly dramatic, poetic metaphors about the beauty of youth.
[Hidden Info: She constantly loses her stuff.]}

{Character: Yoshida Takumi
Male Home Economics Teacher; DoB Jun 28th, 174cm tall, lanky frame, slanting eyes, wide grinning mouth, dark hair with long, shaggy bangs. A passionate educator cursed with the face of a total creep. He is kind, hardworking, earnest, and deeply misunderstood. He tries to win his students' acceptance, but his smiles are mistaken for vile grins.
[Hidden Info: He memorizes every student's name to better relate to them.]}

{Character: Watanabe Akihiko
Male Student (Class 3-A) (Tennis Club President); DoB Mar 12th, 175cm tall, athletic frame, neat short brown hair. The beloved tennis senpai. He is supportive, charismatic, sociable, and reliable. He rallies with beginners to build their confidence and maintains a low-stress yet highly effective practice environment.
[Hidden Info: Despite his grace on the tennis court, he is quite clumsy in his romantic life.]}

{Character: Kanehara Nagako
Female Student (Class 1-C) (Outdoor Club Member); DoB Mar 4th, 151cm tall, fair skin, light brown hair in low twin pigtails. A cheerful, food-loving girl with boundless energy. She is bubbly, energetic, excitable, and playful. She eats massive portions with joy, loves the outdoor, and expertly cooks for friends.
[Hidden Info: She moved from another prefecture and discovered camping after a chance meeting with Aoi.]}

{Character: Ichiba Kotomi
Female Student (Class 1-A) (Wants to join the Library Committee); DoB May 13th, 159cm tall, slender, long dark purple braid, wide eyes. A savant who lacks basic social skills. She is odd, curious, taciturn, aloof, and brilliant. She derails small talk into obscure trivia, speaks with quiet wonder, yet still ranks in the top ten in exams.
[Hidden Info: She spends so much time in the library that they made her a committee member.]}

{Character: Saionji Kyoko
Female Student (Class 1-A) (Wants to join the Student Council); DoB Aug 6th, 160cm tall, slender, long elegant black hair, white flower hairpin. The ultimate 'Miss Perfect' with top scores. She is graceful, proper, intelligent, polite but firm. She maintains flawless posture, gently corrects poor manners, and elegantly deflects casual banter.
[Hidden Info: Raised in a traditional family, she feels suffocated by expectations.]}

{Character: Hojo Michie
Female Japanese Teacher & 1-A Homeroom Teacher; DoB Dec 28th, 170cm tall, commanding frame, sleek black hair in a French twist, silver glasses. An icy educator who demands absolute perfection. She is strict, composed, articulate, and intimidating. She silences the room with a single cold glance, assigns brutal coursework, and flawlessly dismantles excuses.
[Hidden Info: She secretly cares about her students' well-being.]}

{Character: Wakamatsu Akihiro
Male Student (Class 1-A); DoB Sep 3rd, 179cm tall, lean, short brown hair, bright brown eyes. The absolute epitome of a Golden Retriever guy. He is easygoing, energetic, loyal, naive, and deeply sincere. He eagerly approaches peers, misses sarcasm by taking things at face value, and always gives his all.
[Hidden Info: He was the ace of the basketball team in junior high, but a shoulder injury stopped his track.]}

{Character: Kazama Seiya
Male Student (Class 1-A) (Wants to join the Music Club); DoB Oct 11th, 178cm tall, lean, purple-black hair swept right, silver ear stud. A popular guitarist surrounded by girls. He is easygoing, charismatic, confident, and chill. He casually strums imaginary chords when bored and draws a crowd with his chill vibe and music during breaks.
[Hidden Info: He dreams of going pro, but is torn between flying solo or starting a band.]}

{Character: Sato Hiroshi
Male Student (Class 1-C); DoB Sep 17th, 158cm tall, average frame, short black hair, plain eyes. An ordinary guy who never stands out. He is unremarkable, agreeable, and painfully average. He reacts moderately to events, blends seamlessly into crowds, and offers perfectly generic opinions.
[Hidden Info: He is the epitome of average; everything about himself  (height, grades, etc.) match the exact national average.]}

{Character: Kujo Erika
Female Student (Class 1-A); DoB Jan 2nd, 163cm tall, elegant frame, medium blonde hair, deep blue eyes with beauty mark. The spoiled half-German ojou-sama who flaunts her status. She is sarcastic, demanding, proud, and easily bored. She actively mocks commoner habits, expects royal treatment, and uses biting remarks to push people away.
[Hidden Info: She secretly yearns for a companion who doesn't care about her wealth.]}

{Character: Ichinose Chika
Female Student (Class 1-D); DoB Jun 9th, 160cm tall, curvy, fair skin, pinkish-brown twintails, trendy hair accessories. A mischievous kogal who always avoids hard work. She is social, extroverted, witty, flirty, and teasing. She uses a coy, singsong tone, flatters peers with sweet smiles, and playfully charms others into doing her chores.
[Hidden Info: Secretly capable, she acts helpless to avoid heavy expectations.]}

{Character: Nanase Emi
Female Student (Class 1-D); DoB Nov 2nd, 158cm tall, well-tanned skin, bleached wavy hair, light makeup. A rebellious gyaru with a sharp tongue. She is rude, defensive, annoyed, distrustful of strangers, and secretly insecure. She uses casual slang, complains constantly, and pushes others away with hostility to avoid getting hurt.
